---
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro"
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Frontend architecture"
  path="/docs/system/frontend"
  description="Inertia + React portals, Wayfinder route helpers, the shadcn/Tailwind design system, and the build pipeline."
>
  <p>
    KoAkademy's interactive UI is <strong>Inertia 3 with React 19</strong> — server-side
    routing and authorization, client-side rendering — with SSR enabled (<code
      >ssr.tsx</code
    >). There is no separate SPA or client-side router.
  </p>

  <h2>Page map</h2>
  <p>
    Pages live in <code>resources/js/pages/</code> (~184 <code>.tsx</code> pages)
    and mirror the audiences from
    <a href="/docs/system/architecture-domain"
      >Architecture &amp; domain model</a
    >:
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Directory</th>
        <th>Audience</th>
        <th>Highlights</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><code>administrators/</code></td>
        <td>Staff</td>
        <td
          >Dashboard, students (documents, signature pad, checklists), classes
          and scheduling, curriculum, enrollments (applicants, assessment
          preview, analytics), finance, users and online users, roles, audit
          logs, feature toggles, system management (school, branding, grading,
          identifiers, mail, notifications, API keys, SEO, social providers,
          enrollment-policy blueprints)</td
        >
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>faculty/</code></td>
        <td>Teachers</td>
        <td
          >Dashboard, action center, attendance, classes (posts, submissions,
          grading), schedule (agenda and bird's-eye), forms, resources, toolkit</td
        >
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>student/</code></td>
        <td>Students</td>
        <td
          >Dashboard, classes and submissions, schedule, tuition and statements
          of account, digital ID card</td
        >
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>enrollment/</code></td>
        <td>Public</td>
        <td>Registration wizard and "enrollment closed" pages</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
