  <h2>Routing: Wayfinder + Ziggy</h2>
  <p>
    Frontend code calls backend routes through <strong>Laravel Wayfinder</strong
    >
    — typed helpers generated from the server's controllers/routes (<code
      >@/actions</code
    >, <code>@/routes</code>), wired by the Wayfinder Vite plugin. <strong
      >Do not hard-code URLs</strong
    > in React code; import the generated helper. Ziggy remains available for dynamic
    cases.
  </p>

  <h2>Design system</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>shadcn/ui</strong> (<code>components.json</code>) on Radix UI
      primitives and base-ui — compose these before adding dependencies.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Tailwind CSS 4</strong> via <code>@tailwindcss/vite</code>.</li>
    <li>
      Icons: lucide, tabler, phosphor (pick one per surface; lucide is the
      default).
    </li>
    <li>
      The documentation site maps the same shadcn palette onto Starlight, so
      docs and product share one visual identity.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>Notable libraries and their roles:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Library</th>
        <th>Used for</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>TanStack Table</td>
        <td>Data grids across admin pages</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>TipTap 3</td>
        <td>Rich text (class posts, announcements)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>reactflow</td>
        <td>Blueprint workflow/rule editors</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>recharts + visx</td>
        <td>Dashboard and analytics charts</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>react-hook-form + zod</td>
        <td>Form state and client validation</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>framer-motion</td>
        <td>Micro-interactions (respect reduced motion)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>sonner</td>
        <td>Toasts</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>signature_pad</td>
        <td>Student signature capture</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>react-to-print, cmdk</td>
        <td>Print flows, command palette</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>laravel-echo + pusher-js</td>
        <td>Real-time (see Queues &amp; PDF)</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Build pipeline</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Vite 8</strong> with <code>laravel-vite-plugin</code> 3 handles dev HMR
    and production builds; <code>vite-module-loader.js</code> wires module-provided
    frontend entries (Laravel Modules). The production Docker image builds assets
    with Bun in a dedicated stage; CI builds with
    <code>npm run build</code> on Node 22.
  </p>

  <h2>Conventions (enforced in review)</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>TypeScript</strong> for all React code.</li>
    <li>Prefer existing design-system primitives; justify new dependencies.</li>
    <li>
      Preserve keyboard access, visible focus, meaningful labels, reduced-motion
      behavior, loading states, and actionable error messages.
    </li>
    <li>
      Forms: Inertia <code>useForm</code> (or Wayfinder form helpers) with server-side
      validation as the source of truth.
    </li>
    <li>
      Formatting: <code>npm run format</code> (Prettier); linting: <code
        >npm run lint</code
      > (ESLint).
    </li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
